===Sootopolis Gym===
[[File:Sootopolis Gym 1F E.png|thumb|Sootopolis Gym, 1F]]
[[File:Sootopolis Gym B1F E.png|thumb|Sootopolis Gym, B1F]]

{{sign|E|header}}
